(4, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_001', NULL, 'location_reference', 'Reference establishing shot of Adeyemi Auto Workshop. Single-story concrete building, corrugated metal roof, open bay doors, cluttered workbenches, tool racks, car lifts Busy, gritty, lived-in, mechanically noisy', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/assets/locations/LOC_001.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:40:09', '2026-09-28 10:40:09'),
(5, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_002', NULL, 'location_reference', 'Reference establishing shot of Sub-Basement Archive. Concrete walls, exposed pipes, reinforced steel door, server racks, analog dials, projection screen Claustrophobic, tense, technologically advanced yet decaying', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/assets/locations/LOC_002.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:40:09', '2026-09-28 10:40:09'),
(6, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01_SH_01', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'A medium shot of Kemi Adeyemi, a 5\'10 lean muscular Nigerian man with short cropped fade hair, light stubble, deep brown weathered skin, and a small scar above his left eyebrow. He wears a faded gray mechanic\'s t-shirt and dark work pants, with grease-stained forearms. He is prying up a warped wooden floorboard in a cluttered auto workshop with concrete floors, corrugated metal walls, and scattered tools. Harsh fluorescent and daylight mix. Gritty, realistic cinematic style.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_001/images/EP_001_SC_01_SH_01.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(7, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01_SH_02', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'A close-up of Kemi Adeyemi\'s grease-stained hands gripping a flathead screwdriver, chipping at thick yellowed wax sealing a heavy rusted iron hatch set into a concrete workshop floor. The hatch has intricate but corroded rivets. Kemi\'s face is partially visible in the frame, showing deep brown skin, light stubble, and a focused, weary expression. Cinematic lighting, high detail, realistic texture.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_001/images/EP_001_SC_01_SH_02.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(8, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01_SH_03', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'A low-angle medium shot of Kemi Adeyemi leaning over an open floor hatch in his auto workshop. He is straining to lift a heavy, unfamiliar mechanical device. The device features intricate brass dials, copper wiring, and strange geometric metal panels. Kemi\'s face shows stunned curiosity, his short cropped fade and light stubble visible, deep brown skin glistening with sweat. The workshop background is slightly out of focus. Cinematic, highly detailed, photorealistic.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_001/images/EP_001_SC_01_SH_03.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(9, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01_SH_04', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'An over-the-shoulder extreme close-up of Kemi Adeyemi examining a complex mechanical device. The device features analog dials, strange geometric copper panels, and heavy rivets. Kemi\'s face is in profile, showing his sharp jawline, high cheekbones, thick arched eyebrows, and the scar above his left eyebrow. His expression is one of stunned curiosity. The background is the cluttered auto workshop, softly blurred. Cinematic lighting, hyper-detailed textures, photorealistic.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_001/images/EP_001_SC_01_SH_04.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(10, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02_SH_01', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'A gritty Nigerian auto workshop interior with concrete floors and corrugated metal roofing. Kemi Adeyemi, a lean muscular man with deep brown skin, short cropped fade, sharp jawline, light stubble, and a small scar above his left eyebrow, wears a dark grey mechanic work shirt and canvas trousers. He stands beside a heavy mechanical device with intricate analog dials and strange geometry resting on the floor. Tunde Balogun, a stocky sturdy man with medium brown skin, short afro, rounder open face, full lips, and freckles across his nose bridge, wears a faded blue work shirt and dark cargo pants. Tunde steps into frame wiping grease from his hands, looking down at the machine. Overhead fluorescent light mixes with daylight from an open bay door. Cinematic lighting, photorealistic.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_001/images/EP_001_SC_02_SH_01.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(11, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02_SH_02', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Close-up over-the-shoulder view in the workshop. Tunde\'s calloused hands hover inches from the heavy mechanical device\'s metallic casing. Kemi stands beside him, watching intently. The machine\'s intricate dials and rusted metal accents catch harsh overhead shadows. Background shows cluttered tool racks and car lifts. Photorealistic, detailed textures.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_001/images/EP_001_SC_02_SH_02.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(12, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02_SH_03', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Wide shot in the workshop. Kemi and Tunde work together on the concrete floor, sliding heavy canvas straps under the mechanical device. Wooden rollers are positioned underneath. Tool benches and corrugated roof frame the background. Both men show focused physical exertion. Natural daylight and workshop lamps illuminate the scene.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_001/images/EP_001_SC_02_SH_03.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(13, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02_SH_04', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Medium shot facing the pair. The heavy mechanical device is now fully secured on a makeshift dolly with tight canvas straps. Tunde fastens the final metal buckle. Kemi wipes sweat from his forehead, standing ready. Workshop environment with concrete floor and open bay door in background. Warm afternoon light highlights dust motes in the air.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_001/images/EP_001_SC_02_SH_04.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(14, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_03_SH_01', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Cinematic medium shot, low angle. Kemi Adeyemi, a lean muscular Nigerian mechanic with deep brown skin, short cropped fade, light stubble, grease-stained forearms, wearing dark blue mechanic coveralls and sturdy boots, stands on a narrow concrete staircase. Beside him is Tunde Balogun, a stocky Nigerian man with medium brown skin, short afro, wearing a dark green t-shirt and cargo pants. They grip the handles of a heavy makeshift dolly carrying a large rusted mechanical device with intricate analog dials and strange geometric panels. The stairs are damp, lined with exposed rusted pipes, dimly lit by a cool overhead work light, misty atmosphere, photorealistic, detailed textures.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_001/images/EP_001_SC_03_SH_01.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
