(45, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_02_SH_04', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Wide shot of the sub-basement archive dominated by a massive, decaying temporal resonance machine with exposed wiring and glowing core. Nneka Okafor (light brown smooth skin, angular sharp features, hazel piercing eyes, sleek shoulder-length jet black bob, silver geometric earrings, slender poised build) stands forward, arms outstretched, urging action. Kemi Adeyemi (deep brown lightly weathered skin, sharp jawline, high cheekbones, dark brown alert eyes, short cropped fade natural black hair, light stubble, small scar above left eyebrow, lean muscular build, grease-stained forearms) stands mid-frame, hand hovering near a control lever, frozen in hesitation. Tunde Balogun (medium brown skin, rounder open features, warm brown eyes, short neatly trimmed afro, freckles across nose bridge, stocky sturdy build, calloused hands) braces against the vibrating console to the right. Pulsing red and blue emergency lights illuminate the concrete walls and exposed pipes.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_003/images/EP_003_SC_02_SH_04.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(46, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_03_SH_01', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Cinematic close-up of Kemi Adeyemi, a deep brown-skinned mechanic with sharp jawline, high cheekbones, short cropped fade, light stubble, and a small scar above his left eyebrow. Glowing red neural interface cables are connected to a port behind his ear, pulsing with light. His dark brown eyes are wide with shock. He grips a heavy metal control lever, grease-stained forearms visible. Background shows a claustrophobic sub-basement archive with concrete walls, exposed pipes, and server racks bathed in pulsing red emergency strobes and cold blue monitor light. Photorealistic, high detail, cinematic lighting.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_003/images/EP_003_SC_03_SH_01.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(47, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_03_SH_02', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Medium shot from behind Tunde Balogun, a medium brown-skinned man with rounder open features, short neat afro, freckles across his nose bridge, and calloused hands. He is reaching for a large industrial breaker switch. In the mid-ground, Kemi Adeyemi stumbles forward, hands pressed to his temples, eyes squeezed shut then snapping open. The air around Kemi shows faint, ghostly double-exposure projections of old workshop scenes and historical figures. Concrete sub-basement walls, exposed pipes, red emergency lighting. Photorealistic, cinematic composition.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_003/images/EP_003_SC_03_SH_02.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(48, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_03_SH_03', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Medium two-shot of Nneka Okafor, a light brown-skinned woman with angular sharp features, sleek shoulder-length jet black bob, thin well-groomed eyebrows, silver geometric earrings, and faint tension lines around her eyes. She stands beside Kemi Adeyemi at a complex control console. Nneka\'s hands are rapidly manipulating a ruggedized keypad and stabilizing a glowing neural interface cable connected to Kemi. Kemi leans heavily against the console, sweating, eyes unfocused. The sub-basement archive background is filled with tangled cables, server racks, and rapidly flashing red warning lights. Cinematic, high detail, photorealistic.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_003/images/EP_003_SC_03_SH_03.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(49, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_03_SH_04', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Extreme close-up of Kemi Adeyemi\'s face, deep brown skin glistening with sweat, sharp jawline tense, dark brown eyes wide with terror and disorientation. Glowing red neural interface cables pulse violently behind his ears. Background is a blurred, vibrating sub-basement archive with intense blinding white and red light emanating from the machine core. Dust particles suspended in the air. Tunde Balogun and Nneka Okafor are visible in the shallow depth-of-field background, straining against the console. Photorealistic, cinematic lighting, high contrast.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_003/images/EP_003_SC_03_SH_04.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
