(54, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_01_SH_01', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Sub-Basement Archive with concrete walls, exposed pipes, and a large dormant temporal machine emitting faint residual blue energy. Kemi Adeyemi, a 5\'10\" lean muscular Nigerian man with deep brown skin, short cropped fade natural black hair, light stubble, sharp jawline, high cheekbones, dark brown alert eyes, stands still facing the machine. He wears practical mechanic work clothes. Cool blue and amber industrial lighting, claustrophobic atmosphere, cinematic composition.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_004/images/EP_004_SC_01_SH_01.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(55, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_01_SH_02', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Sub-Basement Archive doorway. Nneka Okafor, a 5\'7\" slender poised Nigerian woman with light brown smooth skin, sleek shoulder-length jet black bob, angular sharp features, hazel piercing eyes, thin well-groomed eyebrows, silver geometric earrings, steps into the frame. She looks at the dormant machine with a softened expression. Kemi is visible in the background. Dim industrial lighting, dust motes in the air, tense atmosphere.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_004/images/EP_004_SC_01_SH_02.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
