(60, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_02_SH_03', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'A cinematic wide shot in the Sub-Basement Archive showing concrete walls, exposed pipes, server racks, and a massive dormant machine core in the background. Kemi Adeyemi, lean muscular build, deep brown skin, short cropped fade, sharp jawline, grease-stained forearms, braces against a main console. Nneka Okafor, slender poised build, light brown skin, sleek shoulder-length jet black bob, angular features, silver geometric earrings, stabilizes her stance beside him. Energy arcs jump between pipes. Console screens flash red error codes. Harsh strobing red and white emergency lighting dominates the scene. Photorealistic, cinematic lighting, detailed textures.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_004/images/EP_004_SC_02_SH_03.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(61, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_02_SH_04', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'A cinematic medium close-up two-shot facing forward. Kemi Adeyemi, lean muscular build, deep brown skin, short cropped fade, sharp jawline, dark brown alert eyes, grease-stained forearms, grips a heavy manual override lever. Nneka Okafor, slender poised build, light brown skin, sleek shoulder-length jet black bob, angular features, hazel piercing eyes, silver geometric earrings, stands beside him watching a console display. The display shows coordinates flashing green with a digital countdown timer. Sub-basement concrete walls and exposed pipes are softly blurred in the background. Stabilized cool blue lighting mixed with steady green countdown glow. Photorealistic, cinematic lighting, detailed textures.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_004/images/EP_004_SC_02_SH_04.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(62, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03_SH_01', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Cinematic medium shot of Kemi Adeyemi, a lean 5\'10 Nigerian mechanic with short cropped fade, deep brown skin, light stubble, wearing a grease-stained grey mechanic\'s jumpsuit, gripping the edge of a complex analog console. Beside him stands Nneka Okafor, a slender Nigerian tech investigator with a sleek jet-black shoulder-length bob, light brown skin, wearing a dark tactical utility vest over a black t-shirt. The Sub-Basement Archive features rough concrete walls, exposed rusted pipes, and server racks. Blue-white electrical arcs crackle across glowing analog dials and a large projection screen. Harsh emergency strobes and cool blue machine lighting create high-contrast shadows. Photorealistic, cinematic lighting, detailed textures.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_004/images/EP_004_SC_03_SH_01.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(63, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03_SH_02', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Extreme close-up of Kemi Adeyemi\'s grease-stained forearms and hands forcefully pushing down a heavy industrial red override lever on a complex machine console. His knuckles are white, sweat glistens on his deep brown skin. The lever housing is brushed steel with faded warning decals. In the shallow depth of field background, Nneka Okafor\'s sleek black bob and tactical vest are visible as she monitors adjacent screens. Cool blue ambient light mixes with warm practical lighting from the console. Cinematic, highly detailed, photorealistic.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_004/images/EP_004_SC_03_SH_02.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(64, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03_SH_03', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Close-up of Kemi Adeyemi\'s face, sharp jawline, high cheekbones, short cropped fade, deep brown skin with light stubble. His dark brown eyes look upward with a mix of sorrow and resolve. Flickering light from a large projection screen casts shifting blue and amber tones across his features. The background shows the rough concrete walls and exposed pipes of the Sub-Basement Archive. Cinematic lighting, shallow depth of field, photorealistic.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_004/images/EP_004_SC_03_SH_03.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(65, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03_SH_04', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Wide shot of the Sub-Basement Archive showing the full machine console and projection screen. Kemi Adeyemi and Nneka Okafor stand a few feet back from the console, shoulders relaxed. The machine\'s core emits a faint, fading blue glow. The concrete walls, exposed pipes, and server racks are visible in the dim lighting. Dust motes float in the air. The atmosphere is heavy and silent. Cinematic, photorealistic, wide framing.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_004/images/EP_004_SC_03_SH_04.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(66, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04_SH_01', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Wide shot looking up concrete stairs through an opening heavy steel door. Sunlight floods the frame, illuminating dust particles. Kemi Adeyemi, a lean muscular Nigerian man with deep brown skin, short cropped fade, and grease-stained forearms, steps forward with an exhausted but relieved posture. Behind him, Nneka Okafor, a slender Nigerian woman with light brown skin, a sleek shoulder-length jet black bob, and silver geometric earrings, follows with a watchful but calm expression. The background transitions from dark sub-basement shadows to the bright, cluttered interior of an auto workshop.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_004/images/EP_004_SC_04_SH_01.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(67, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04_SH_02', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Medium close-up of Kemi Adeyemi standing in a sunlit auto workshop. He has deep brown skin, a sharp jawline, thick slightly arched eyebrows, and a small scar above his left eyebrow. He holds a worn gray shop rag, wiping thick black grease from his forearms. His short cropped fade and lean muscular build are visible. Bright sunlight streams from off-screen bay doors, casting warm highlights. Background shows blurred tool racks and car lifts of the Adeyemi Auto Workshop.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_004/images/EP_004_SC_04_SH_02.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(68, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04_SH_03', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Medium two-shot of Kemi Adeyemi and Tunde Balogun at a cluttered metal workbench in a sunlit auto workshop. Tunde, a stocky Nigerian man with medium brown skin, a neatly trimmed short afro, freckles across his nose, and calloused hands, slides a standard steel wrench across the bench. Kemi, with his lean muscular build and short cropped fade, reaches out to grip the wrench handle. Sunlight streams through open bay doors in the background, illuminating dust and mechanical parts on the bench.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_004/images/EP_004_SC_04_SH_03.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10'),
(69, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', NULL, 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04_SH_04', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shot_image', 'Wide high-angle shot of the Adeyemi Auto Workshop interior. Kemi Adeyemi and Tunde Balogun work side-by-side at a cluttered metal workbench, Kemi deliberately facing away from the stairwell area. Nneka Okafor stands calmly near the large open bay doors in the background, her sleek shoulder-length bob and silver geometric earrings catching the sunlight. The workshop is filled with bright natural daylight, car lifts, tool racks, and scattered mechanical parts. The atmosphere is peaceful and grounded.', 'queued', NULL, '/ai_movies/nigerian_mechanic_past_machine/episodes/EP_004/images/EP_004_SC_04_SH_04.png', NULL, '2026-09-28 10:48:10', '2026-09-28 10:48:10');

