INSERT INTO `scene_plan` (`scene_id`, `project_id`, `episode_id`, `scene_number`, `beat`, `location_id`, `character_ids`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001', 1, 'Kemi clears debris and pries up a warped section of the workshop floor, revealing a rusted metal hatch sealed with old wax. After struggling to break the seal, he lowers a heavy, unfamiliar mechanical device into the light. The scene begins with mundane renovation fatigue and ends with stunned curiosity as the object\'s intricate dials and strange geometry defy normal automotive tools.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_001', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\"]', '2026-09-26 00:29:27', '2026-09-26 00:29:27'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001', 2, 'Kemi summons Tunde, who initially jokes about finding old car parts but quickly grows serious upon seeing the machine\'s sheer weight and complexity. They rig a makeshift dolly and coordinate a careful lift, agreeing to stash it in the rarely-used sub-basement to avoid prying eyes from clients. The beat starts with cautious skepticism and transitions into focused teamwork, ending as they secure the device for transport.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_001', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\"]', '2026-09-26 00:29:27', '2026-09-26 00:29:27'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001', 3, 'The pair navigates the narrow concrete stairs, hauling the machine down into the damp, pipe-lined sub-basement. Tunde helps position it against a reinforced wall and offers a few practical warnings about moisture and power draws before heading back upstairs to finish his shift. The scene shifts from physical exertion to quiet isolation, ending with Kemi standing alone in the dim basement, the machine humming faintly in the stillness.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_002', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\"]', '2026-09-26 00:29:27', '2026-09-26 00:29:27'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001', 4, 'Left alone, Kemi wipes dust from the machine\'s control panel and accidentally brushes a corroded toggle switch. A sudden surge of energy ignites a series of analog dials, projecting a fragmented, flickering echo of his father working late in the very same room years ago. The scene begins with cautious examination and ends in profound shock and quiet awe as the ghostly image fades, leaving Kemi breathless and questioning everything he knew about his father\'s past.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_002', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\"]', '2026-09-26 00:29:27', '2026-09-26 00:29:27'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002_SC_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002', 1, 'Kemi descends into the Sub-Basement Archive to test the temporal machine. The initial echoes are chaotic and flickering, forcing him to manually adjust analog dials and recalibrate power flow. He ends the scene exhausted but having achieved a brief moment of stability, realizing the machine requires precise physical synchronization rather than brute force.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_002', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\"]', '2026-09-26 21:58:57', '2026-09-26 21:58:57'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002_SC_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002', 2, 'With the machine stabilized, Kemi focuses a specific temporal coordinate and watches coherent echoes materialize. He witnesses fragmented but clear visions of his father working late into the night, visibly stressed and hiding documents before his disappearance. The scene closes with Kemi emotionally shaken but determined, having uncovered the first concrete clue about his father\'s final days.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_002', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\"]', '2026-09-26 21:58:57', '2026-09-26 21:58:57'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002_SC_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002', 3, 'Back in the main Adeyemi Auto Workshop, Nneka arrives unannounced, introducing herself as an academic researcher studying local technological history. She politely interviews Kemi about the workshop\'s equipment while her sharp questions and lingering glances toward the basement door reveal hidden motives. The scene ends with Nneka hearing a low mechanical hum from below and her demeanor shifting from professional to intensely curious.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_001', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', '2026-09-26 21:58:57', '2026-09-26 21:58:57'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002_SC_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002', 4, 'Nneka requests to inspect the workshop\'s lower levels under the guise of checking ventilation systems, pressing Kemi to comply. Kemi quickly devises a cover story about stored spare parts while covertly powering down the basement machine to mask the noise. The scene concludes with Nneka stepping toward the stairwell, her suspicion now openly challenging Kemi\'s secrecy, leaving the temporal experiment suspended and the confrontation imminent.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_001', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', '2026-09-26 21:58:57', '2026-09-26 21:58:57'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003', 1, 'Nneka forces open the reinforced door to the Sub-Basement Archive, catching Kemi and Tunde off guard. She drops her investigator facade, revealing she worked alongside Kemi\'s father and that the machine is a banned temporal resonance experiment. Kemi reacts with shock and defensiveness, while Tunde steps between them as tension spikes.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_002', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', '2026-09-27 06:38:13', '2026-09-27 06:38:13'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003', 2, 'Nneka explains the catastrophic ethical breaches and government shutdown that buried the project, urging Kemi to shut the device down before it destabilizes. Kemi wrestles with conflicting loyalties, while Tunde monitors the console and notices erratic voltage spikes and overheating cores. He warns that the machine is already beginning to fail on its own.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_002', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', '2026-09-27 06:38:13', '2026-09-27 06:38:13'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003', 3, 'The machine violently overloads, triggering a feedback loop through Kemi\'s neural interface. Severe memory bleed begins, flooding his senses with fragmented, uncontrolled visions from the past. Tunde frantically attempts to manually cut power while Nneka tries to stabilize the decaying interface, but the system resists all shutdown commands.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_002', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', '2026-09-27 06:38:13', '2026-09-27 06:38:13'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003', 4, 'Trapped in the memory bleed, Kemi confronts a vivid, painful echo of his father\'s final moments, witnessing the impossible choice that led to the machine\'s creation and his father\'s disappearance. The emotional revelation clashes with Tunde\'s desperate physical efforts to kill the power. The scene ends with Kemi on the verge of losing himself entirely to the past.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_002', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', '2026-09-27 06:38:13', '2026-09-27 06:38:13'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004', 1, 'Kemi stands before the dormant machine in the Sub-Basement, finally internalizing that his father stayed behind to stabilize the temporal rift. Nneka enters, her usual hostility softened by the gravity of the situation. Kemi resolves to shut it down, asking for her technical support to do it safely. Ends with Nneka reluctantly agreeing, setting a tense but cooperative tone.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_002', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', '2026-09-27 07:17:30', '2026-09-27 07:17:30'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004', 2, 'Working at the main console, Kemi and Nneka cross-reference fragmented logs to isolate the final echo\'s coordinates needed for a clean power-down. Nneka\'s analytical skills complement Kemi\'s intuitive understanding of his father\'s engineering. They successfully pinpoint the coordinates, but the machine\'s failing systems begin to flicker, raising the stakes. Ends with the coordinates locked in and the countdown initiated.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_002', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', '2026-09-27 07:17:30', '2026-09-27 07:17:30'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004', 3, 'As the shutdown sequence begins, the machine violently resists, throwing unstable energy surges. Kemi must manually override the safety protocols while Nneka stabilizes the power grid. Emotionally, Kemi says a quiet goodbye to his father\'s legacy, accepting the finality of the moment. Ends with the core cooling and the echoes fading into silence.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_002', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', '2026-09-27 07:17:30', '2026-09-27 07:17:30'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004', 4, 'The heavy steel door opens as they ascend to the main workshop. Sunlight streams through the bay doors, contrasting with the sub-basement\'s gloom. Kemi wipes grease from his hands, picks up a standard wrench, and joins Tunde at a workbench, deliberately leaving the hidden compartment sealed. Ends with Kemi embracing the present day, the chapter fully closed.', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__LOC_001', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\"]', '2026-09-27 07:17:30', '2026-09-27 07:17:30');

