('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01_SH_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01', 'Medium shot', 'Waist-up, angled slightly downward', 'Floor level, slightly behind Kemi\'s right shoulder', '35mm', 'Slow push-in', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\"]', 'Kemi uses a heavy pry bar to lever up a warped, grease-stained wooden floorboard, wiping sweat from his brow.', 'Weary, focused, mouth pressed firmly in concentration', 'Cluttered auto workshop floor, scattered tools, oil stains, corrugated metal walls in background', 'Harsh overhead fluorescent mixed with natural daylight from open bay doors', 'Gritty, dusty, physically demanding', 8, '[\"Wood splintering\", \"Metal bar scraping concrete\", \"Heavy breathing\", \"Distant workshop hum\"]', 'Low, rhythmic percussion mimicking a heartbeat, slow tempo', 'A medium shot of Kemi Adeyemi, a 5\'10 lean muscular Nigerian man with short cropped fade hair, light stubble, deep brown weathered skin, and a small scar above his left eyebrow. He wears a faded gray mechanic\'s t-shirt and dark work pants, with grease-stained forearms. He is prying up a warped wooden floorboard in a cluttered auto workshop with concrete floors, corrugated metal walls, and scattered tools. Harsh fluorescent and daylight mix. Gritty, realistic cinematic style.', 'Kemi grips the pry bar, muscles tensing as he levers the wood upward. Sawdust and old grease flakes fall. He wipes his forehead with a grimy hand, his expression showing physical fatigue. The camera slowly pushes in as the board cracks.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Establishes Kemi\'s physical state (tired, sweaty) and workshop environment. Floorboard is being removed.', '2026-09-26 20:21:47', '2026-09-26 20:21:47'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01_SH_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01', 'Close-up', 'Tight on hands and hatch', 'Low angle, looking down into the gap', '50mm', 'Static, slight handheld shake', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\"]', 'Kemi uses a screwdriver to chip away thick, hardened wax sealing a rusted iron hatch embedded in the floor.', 'Furrowed brow, intense concentration, lips parted slightly', 'The exposed hatch, rusted metal edges, thick yellowed wax seal, surrounding floorboards', 'Directional light from above casts deep shadows in the hatch rim', 'Tense, mysterious, physically resistant', 8, '[\"Metal scraping wax\", \"Chipping sounds\", \"Creaking wood\", \"Tense ambient drone\"]', 'Subtle string swell, introducing a sense of unease and discovery', 'A close-up of Kemi Adeyemi\'s grease-stained hands gripping a flathead screwdriver, chipping at thick yellowed wax sealing a heavy rusted iron hatch set into a concrete workshop floor. The hatch has intricate but corroded rivets. Kemi\'s face is partially visible in the frame, showing deep brown skin, light stubble, and a focused, weary expression. Cinematic lighting, high detail, realistic texture.', 'Kemi\'s hands work methodically, scraping away the hardened wax. Chunks of wax fall onto the concrete. The rusted metal hatch slowly becomes visible. His knuckles whiten as he applies more pressure, the screwdriver struggling against the stubborn seal.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Focus shifts to the hidden hatch. Wax seal is being broken. Kemi\'s fatigue is giving way to confusion.', '2026-09-26 20:21:47', '2026-09-26 20:21:47'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01_SH_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01', 'Low-angle medium shot', 'Full body of Kemi, hatch open, device emerging', 'Floor level, looking up at Kemi and into the hatch', '24mm', 'Slow tilt down into the hatch, then tilt back up to Kemi', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\"]', 'Kemi grips chains or heavy straps attached to the device, heaving it upward out of the hidden compartment.', 'Eyes widen, breath catches, fatigue replaced by stunned curiosity', 'Open hatch revealing dark compartment below, the heavy mechanical device with brass dials and strange geometric panels rising into the workshop light', 'Light catches the dust motes and the metallic surfaces of the device', 'Awe-inspiring, heavy, mysterious', 8, '[\"Heavy chains straining\", \"Metal groaning\", \"Dust settling\", \"Low mechanical hum beginning\"]', 'Orchestral hit transitions into a curious, wonder-filled motif with analog synth tones', 'A low-angle medium shot of Kemi Adeyemi leaning over an open floor hatch in his auto workshop. He is straining to lift a heavy, unfamiliar mechanical device. The device features intricate brass dials, copper wiring, and strange geometric metal panels. Kemi\'s face shows stunned curiosity, his short cropped fade and light stubble visible, deep brown skin glistening with sweat. The workshop background is slightly out of focus. Cinematic, highly detailed, photorealistic.', 'Kemi pulls upward with both hands, the heavy device slowly rising from the dark compartment. Dust falls from its surface. As it breaks the surface level, the workshop light reflects off its dials and panels. Kemi\'s posture shifts from strain to stillness as he takes it in.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'The device is now fully visible. Kemi\'s emotional state has shifted from fatigue to awe. The device\'s appearance is established.', '2026-09-26 20:21:47', '2026-09-26 20:21:47'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01_SH_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_01', 'Extreme close-up', 'Tight on Kemi\'s face and the device\'s control panel', 'Behind Kemi\'s left shoulder, focusing on the device', '85mm', 'Very slow push-in on the device\'s dials', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\"]', 'Kemi rests his hands on the device, leaning in closely to examine the unfamiliar controls and geometry.', 'Breathless, deeply intrigued, eyes tracking the details', 'The device dominates the frame, workshop tools blurred in the background', 'Warm practical light from overhead lamps highlights the brass and metal textures', 'Quiet reverence, profound mystery', 8, '[\"Cloth wiping metal\", \"Faint ticking of internal gears\", \"Quiet workshop ambiance\", \"Deep bass drone\"]', 'Sparse, atmospheric piano notes, leaving room for the mechanical sounds', 'An over-the-shoulder extreme close-up of Kemi Adeyemi examining a complex mechanical device. The device features analog dials, strange geometric copper panels, and heavy rivets. Kemi\'s face is in profile, showing his sharp jawline, high cheekbones, thick arched eyebrows, and the scar above his left eyebrow. His expression is one of stunned curiosity. The background is the cluttered auto workshop, softly blurred. Cinematic lighting, hyper-detailed textures, photorealistic.', 'Kemi leans closer, his eyes scanning the intricate dials and panels. He gently places a grease-stained hand on the cool metal surface. The camera slowly pushes in on the device\'s complex geometry. Kemi\'s breathing is visible, his posture still and awestruck.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Scene ends with Kemi fully engaged with the device, fatigued but captivated. Sets up the next scene where he summons Tunde.', '2026-09-26 20:21:47', '2026-09-26 20:21:47'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02_SH_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02', 'Medium Two-Shot', 'Waist up', 'Eye level, slight side angle', '35mm', 'Static with subtle push-in', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\"]', 'Kemi gestures toward the heavy mechanical device resting on the concrete floor. Tunde steps into frame from the workshop entrance, wiping grease from his hands, and looks down at the object.', 'Kemi shows quiet awe and urgency. Tunde shifts from casual amusement to focused curiosity.', 'Adeyemi Auto Workshop interior: concrete floor, corrugated metal roof, cluttered workbenches, tool racks, and an open bay door in the background.', 'Overhead fluorescent mixed with natural daylight streaming from the open bay door.', 'Gritty, lived-in, tense curiosity', 8, '[\"Footsteps on concrete\", \"Distant workshop machinery hum\", \"Metal tool clink\"]', 'Low ambient workshop drone transitioning into a subtle suspenseful tone', 'A gritty Nigerian auto workshop interior with concrete floors and corrugated metal roofing. Kemi Adeyemi, a lean muscular man with deep brown skin, short cropped fade, sharp jawline, light stubble, and a small scar above his left eyebrow, wears a dark grey mechanic work shirt and canvas trousers. He stands beside a heavy mechanical device with intricate analog dials and strange geometry resting on the floor. Tunde Balogun, a stocky sturdy man with medium brown skin, short afro, rounder open face, full lips, and freckles across his nose bridge, wears a faded blue work shirt and dark cargo pants. Tunde steps into frame wiping grease from his hands, looking down at the machine. Overhead fluorescent light mixes with daylight from an open bay door. Cinematic lighting, photorealistic.', 'Kemi gestures toward the machine. Tunde steps forward, his expression shifting from casual to serious as he inspects the object. Camera holds steady with a subtle push-in.', 'deformed anatomy, extra/missing fingers, extra limbs, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Tunde just arrived at the workshop floor. The machine is revealed on the ground. Kemi\'s exhaustion is overridden by curiosity.', '2026-09-26 20:52:12', '2026-09-26 20:52:12'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02_SH_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02', 'Close-Up Over-the-Shoulder', 'Chest up, OTS from Tunde', 'Slightly low angle looking toward machine', '50mm', 'Slow tilt down to machine details', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\"]', 'Tunde reaches out but stops inches from the dials. He presses a gloved hand against the metallic casing to test its weight. Kemi watches his reaction closely.', 'Tunde is serious and analytical. Kemi is expectant and cautious.', 'Workshop floor dominated by the mechanical device. Background shows blurred tool racks and car lifts.', 'Harsh overhead shadows catching metallic textures and rusted accents on the device.', 'Heavy, mechanical mystery', 8, '[\"Gloved hand thud against metal\", \"Low mechanical hum\", \"Heavy breathing\"]', 'Tense, rhythmic percussion building gradually', 'Close-up over-the-shoulder view in the workshop. Tunde\'s calloused hands hover inches from the heavy mechanical device\'s metallic casing. Kemi stands beside him, watching intently. The machine\'s intricate dials and rusted metal accents catch harsh overhead shadows. Background shows cluttered tool racks and car lifts. Photorealistic, detailed textures.', 'Tunde presses a gloved hand against the machine\'s side to test its weight, then pulls back. Kemi nods slowly. Camera tilts down slightly to focus on the machine\'s details.', 'deformed anatomy, extra/missing fingers, extra limbs, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Tunde recognizes the machine\'s weight and complexity. Decision is made to relocate it immediately.', '2026-09-26 20:52:12', '2026-09-26 20:52:12'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02_SH_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02', 'Wide Shot', 'Full body', 'Eye level, side profile', '24mm', 'Slow pan following action', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\"]', 'Both men work together to slide heavy canvas straps under the machine. Tunde positions wooden rollers underneath while Kemi adjusts the angle and tension.', 'Focused, determined, showing physical exertion.', 'Workshop floor with scattered tools and makeshift dolly materials. Corrugated roof and workbenches frame the background.', 'Diffused daylight mixing with warm workshop lamps.', 'Collaborative, urgent but controlled', 8, '[\"Canvas stretching\", \"Wood scraping concrete\", \"Tool clatter\", \"Synchronized footsteps\"]', 'Driving, industrious rhythm with steady tempo', 'Wide shot in the workshop. Kemi and Tunde work together on the concrete floor, sliding heavy canvas straps under the mechanical device. Wooden rollers are positioned underneath. Tool benches and corrugated roof frame the background. Both men show focused physical exertion. Natural daylight and workshop lamps illuminate the scene.', 'Both men coordinate their movements, adjusting the straps and positioning the rollers. They communicate with hand signals and brief nods. Camera pans slowly to follow their collaborative effort.', 'deformed anatomy, extra/missing fingers, extra limbs, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Makeshift dolly is being rigged. Teamwork replaces initial skepticism. Machine is being prepared for movement.', '2026-09-26 20:52:12', '2026-09-26 20:52:12'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02_SH_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_02', 'Medium Shot', 'Waist up', 'Eye level, frontal', '35mm', 'Static', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\"]', 'Tunde fastens the final strap buckle. Kemi wipes sweat from his forehead and steps back to assess the secured load. They grip the dolly handles, ready to move.', 'Satisfied, relieved, anticipatory.', 'Machine fully secured on makeshift dolly. Workshop background with open bay door visible.', 'Warm afternoon light filtering in, highlighting dust motes in the air.', 'Accomplished, forward momentum', 8, '[\"Metal buckle click\", \"Fabric rustle\", \"Distant radio chatter\", \"Gripping handle creak\"]', 'Resolving tension, subtle forward momentum leading to next location', 'Medium shot facing the pair. The heavy mechanical device is now fully secured on a makeshift dolly with tight canvas straps. Tunde fastens the final metal buckle. Kemi wipes sweat from his forehead, standing ready. Workshop environment with concrete floor and open bay door in background. Warm afternoon light highlights dust motes in the air.', 'Tunde clicks the buckle shut and steps back. Kemi gives a satisfied nod. They prepare to grip the dolly handles. Camera remains static, capturing the moment of readiness.', 'deformed anatomy, extra/missing fingers, extra limbs, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Device is fully secured on the dolly. Agreement reached to transport it to the sub-basement. Scene ends with transport ready.', '2026-09-26 20:52:12', '2026-09-26 20:52:12'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_03_SH_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_03', 'Medium tracking shot', 'Two-shot, slightly low angle', 'Behind and slightly below the staircase', '35mm', 'Slow downward tracking following the descent', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\"]', 'Carefully maneuvering a heavy mechanical device on a makeshift dolly down narrow concrete stairs, coordinating steps to avoid slipping on damp steps.', 'Focused, strained but controlled', 'Narrow concrete staircase leading into a damp sub-basement, exposed rusted pipes along walls, misty air', 'Dim, cool-toned ambient light filtering from above, supplemented by a single handheld work light', 'Tense, physically demanding, claustrophobic', 8, '[\"heavy footsteps on concrete\", \"metal dolly wheels grinding\", \"distant water dripping\", \"grunts of exertion\"]', 'Low, rhythmic percussion mimicking heavy breathing and steady movement', 'Cinematic medium shot, low angle. Kemi Adeyemi, a lean muscular Nigerian mechanic with deep brown skin, short cropped fade, light stubble, grease-stained forearms, wearing dark blue mechanic coveralls and sturdy boots, stands on a narrow concrete staircase. Beside him is Tunde Balogun, a stocky Nigerian man with medium brown skin, short afro, wearing a dark green t-shirt and cargo pants. They grip the handles of a heavy makeshift dolly carrying a large rusted mechanical device with intricate analog dials and strange geometric panels. The stairs are damp, lined with exposed rusted pipes, dimly lit by a cool overhead work light, misty atmosphere, photorealistic, detailed textures.', 'Camera slowly tracks downward as both men carefully step down the damp concrete stairs, shifting their weight to balance the heavy dolly. The mechanical device tilts slightly with each step, dials catching faint light. Condensation drips from pipes in the background.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, missing 