('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_03_SH_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_001_SC_03', 'Wide establishing shot', 'Full environment with characters in mid-ground', 'Eye level, facing the reinforced concrete wall', '24mm', 'Static, slight pan left to right', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\"]', 'Rolling the dolly across the damp concrete floor to position the machine against a thick reinforced wall.', 'Determined, relieved to reach the bottom', 'Sub-basement archive, damp concrete floor, exposed vertical pipes, reinforced structural wall, scattered dust and old equipment boxes', 'Dim, greenish-yellow emergency lighting, shadows pooling in corners', 'Heavy, damp, industrial decay', 8, '[\"dolly wheels rolling on wet concrete\", \"heavy thud as device settles\", \"echoing footsteps\", \"hum of distant ventilation\"]', 'Tension slowly releases into a low, steady drone', 'Cinematic wide shot. Kemi Adeyemi and Tunde Balogun inside a damp sub-basement with concrete walls and exposed vertical pipes. They push a heavy makeshift dolly carrying a rusted mechanical device with analog dials toward a thick reinforced concrete wall. Kemi wears dark blue coveralls, grease-stained forearms, short cropped fade. Tunde wears dark green t-shirt and cargo pants, stocky build. Floor is damp concrete, scattered with dust and old crates. Dim greenish-yellow emergency lighting casts long shadows, photorealistic, highly detailed.', 'The dolly rolls steadily across the damp floor, both men guiding it toward the reinforced wall. The mechanical device settles with a solid thud. Dust motes drift in the dim emergency lighting. Pipes line the walls, dripping slowly.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, missing limbs, distorted faces, duplicate characters, inconsistent clothing, blurry subject, low detail, watermark, text', 'Machine positioned against reinforced wall as planned. Dolly still attached. Environment matches LOC_002