('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002_SC_03_SH_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002_SC_03', 'Two-shot', 'Medium', 'Eye level, between them', '35mm', 'Static', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', 'Nneka pulls out a small digital recorder, asking about the building\'s original blueprints. Kemi checks his watch, visibly impatient but maintaining composure.', 'Nneka is intensely focused, professional mask slipping slightly; Kemi is tense, jaw clenched.', 'Workshop interior, workbench between them, tools and car parts scattered.', 'Balanced daylight and artificial workshop lighting', 'Psychological standoff', 8, '[\"Digital recorder click\", \"Distant low mechanical thrum beginning to rise\", \"Metal chair scraping\"]', 'Pulsing low-frequency tone mirroring the basement hum', 'A medium two-shot inside the auto workshop. Kemi Adeyemi, wearing a dark grease-stained jumpsuit with a small scar above his left eyebrow, stands with arms crossed, looking tense. Nneka Okafor, in her olive blazer and silver earrings, holds a compact digital recorder, her hazel eyes sharp and analytical. A cluttered workbench separates them. Sunlight and shadow divide the frame. Cinematic composition, 35mm lens, photorealistic.', 'Kemi glances toward the basement door, his expression tightening as a low vibration seems to pass through the floor. Nneka notices his reaction, her professional demeanor fracturing into keen observation.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'The temporal machine\'s standby cycle is producing a low-frequency hum. Kemi tries to end the conversation but is caught off guard by the noise.', '2026-09-26 22:36:57', '2026-09-26 22:36:57'),
