nd confrontational.', 'Nneka steps forward and places her notebook on the workbench, pointing decisively at the basement door. Kemi\'s shoulders tense and his grip tightens on the bench edge as he turns his head slightly toward her.', 'deformed anatomy, extra or missing fingers, extra limbs, distorted faces, duplicate characters, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject, cartoonish, overly stylized', 'Nneka\'s facade has dropped. Kemi is still in his default mechanic attire. The low hum from the machine is audible but masked by workshop noise.', '2026-09-26 22:46:41', '2026-09-26 22:46:41'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002_SC_04_SH_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002_SC_04', 'Medium close-up', 'Focused on Kemi\'s upper body and face, Nneka partially visible over his shoulder', 'Over-the-shoulder from Nneka\'s perspective', '50mm', 'Slow pan left following Kemi\'s gesture', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', 'Kemi quickly gestures toward a shadowed corner stacked with rusted engine blocks and crates, fabricating a deflection. He keeps his body angled between Nneka and the stairwell.', 'Kemi forces a tight, practiced smile that doesn\'t reach his dark brown eyes. Nneka watches him with narrowed hazel eyes, unconvincingly patient.', 'Workshop interior with towering stacks of unsorted spare parts, oil-stained concrete, and metal shelving units cluttered with tools.', 'Mixed practical lighting with cooler tones from the open bay door contrasting warm workshop fluorescents.', 'Defensive, calculating, thick with deception.', 8, '[\"Metal tools clinking faintly in background\", \"Footsteps on concrete\", \"Low mechanical hum persists\"]', 'Tension builds with subtle string plucks mirroring Kemi\'s nervous calculation.', 'Medium close-up of Kemi Adeyemi inside the auto workshop. He has deep brown skin, a sharp jawline, high cheekbones, short cropped fade, thick slightly arched eyebrows, light stubble, and a lean muscular build with visibly grease-stained forearms. He gestures toward a cluttered corner of rusted engine parts and crates. Behind him, Nneka Okafor\'s angular face and sleek black bob are partially visible. The environment is gritty and lived-in with concrete floors and metal tool racks. Lighting is mixed practical workshop illumination. The mood is defensive and calculating.', 'Kemi gestures broadly toward the stacked spare parts, his body shifting to block the path toward the stairwell. Nneka remains still, her gaze fixed on him, analyzing his deflection.', 'deformed anat