('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002_SC_04_SH_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002_SC_04', 'Medium shot / Insert', 'Focused on Kemi\'s hands and a disguised industrial switchboard mounted on a tool rack', 'Side angle, slightly low', '35mm', 'Static, sharp focus pull from Kemi\'s face to his hand', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\"]', 'While speaking, Kemi casually reaches toward a heavy red toggle switch hidden among standard workshop breakers. He flips it downward. The low mechanical vibration instantly ceases.', 'Kemi\'s expression remains outwardly calm, but his dark brown eyes flicker with relief and urgency. Sweat beads faintly on his high cheekbones.', 'Close-up of the workshop tool rack, heavy electrical panels, hanging wrenches, and oil cans. The background blurs to emphasize the switch.', 'Warm fluorescent light reflecting off metal surfaces, casting sharp highlights on the switch and Kemi\'s grease-stained fingers.', 'Urgent, covert, mechanically tense.', 8, '[\"Heavy industrial switch clunks down\", \"Low mechanical hum abruptly cuts out\", \"Sudden silence in the workshop\"]', 'Music drops to near-silence, emphasizing the sudden absence of the mechanical hum.', 'Medium shot focusing on Kemi Adeyemi\'s hands and a heavy industrial switchboard mounted on a cluttered metal tool rack. Kemi has deep brown skin, lean muscular arms with visible grease stains, and a short cropped fade. His fingers flip a large red toggle switch downward. The environment is the gritty Adeyemi Auto Workshop with hanging tools and oil-stained concrete. Lighting is warm practical workshop illumination. The atmosphere is covert and urgent.', 'Kemi\'s hand reaches out and firmly flips the heavy red switch downward. The camera holds on his hand as the action completes, emphasizing the mechanical click and sudden stillness.', 'deformed anatomy, extra or missing fingers, extra limbs, distorted faces, duplicate characters, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, u