('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002_SC_04_SH_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_002_SC_04', 'Low-angle medium shot', 'Two-shot, emphasizing vertical space and confrontation', 'Low angle, looking up at both characters with the stairwell door directly behind Kemi', '28mm', 'Slow upward tilt', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', 'Nneka ignores the silence and takes a deliberate step toward the metal stairwell door. Kemi immediately steps in front of it, crossing his arms to block her path. The standoff is physical and direct.', 'Nneka\'s hazel eyes lock onto Kemi\'s with open suspicion and determination. Kemi\'s face is hardened, thin lips set in a grim line, eyes alert and defensive.', 'Adeyemi Auto Workshop foreground. The heavy metal basement door and descending ladder are directly behind Kemi. Concrete floor, corrugated ceiling, and scattered tools frame the confrontation.', 'High-contrast practical lighting casting long shadows, emphasizing the physical barrier between them.', 'Confrontational, suspended, imminent conflict.', 8, '[\"Leather shoes step firmly on concrete\", \"Heavy metal door creaks faintly in background\", \"Workshop ambient silence\"]', 'Tense, rhythmic percussion builds slowly, underscoring the physical standoff without resolving.', 'Low-angle medium shot inside the gritty Adeyemi Auto Workshop. Nneka Okafor, with light brown skin, an angular face, sleek shoulder-length jet black bob, thin lips set firmly, slender poised build, and silver geometric earrings, steps forward toward a heavy metal basement door. Kemi Adeyemi, with deep brown skin, sharp jawline, high cheekbones, short cropped fade, thick arched eyebrows, light stubble, lean muscular build, and grease-stained forearms, stands directly in front of the door with arms crossed, blocking her path. The environment features concrete floors, corrugated metal ceiling, and cluttered tool racks. High-contrast practical lighti