('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_02_SH_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_02', 'Medium Shot', 'Two-shot, Nneka slightly forward, Kemi in background', 'Eye-level, static', '35mm', 'Slow push-in', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\"]', 'Nneka gestures urgently toward the humming temporal machine while explaining the project\'s shutdown. Kemi stands with arms crossed, listening defensively.', 'Nneka: grave and urgent. Kemi: defensive, conflicted, lips pressed firmly.', 'Sub-Basement Archive with concrete walls, exposed pipes, and decaying server racks. The machine\'s core emits a steady glow.', 'Cold blue emergency lights mixing with warm console glow, casting long shadows.', 'Tense, claustrophobic, heavy with unspoken danger.', 8, '[\"Low mechanical hum\", \"Distant dripping water\", \"Server rack whirring\"]', 'Low, pulsing synth drone with subtle tension', 'Cinematic still of Nneka Okafor (light brown smooth skin, angular sharp features, hazel piercing eyes, sleek shoulder-length jet black bob, silver geometric earrings, slender poised build, faint tension lines around eyes) standing in a claustrophobic concrete sub-basement archive, gesturing urgently toward a decaying temporal machine. In the background, Kemi Adeyemi (deep brown lightly weathered skin, sharp jawline, high cheekbones, dark brown alert eyes, short cropped fade natural black hair, light stubble, small scar above left eyebrow, lean muscular build, grease-stained forearms) stands with arms crossed, looking defensive. Exposed pipes and server racks line the walls. Cold blue emergency lighting mixes with warm console glow.', 'Nneka steps forward slightly while speaking, her hands moving to emphasize the danger. Kemi\'s shoulders tense, his grip tightening on his own arms. The camera slowly pushes in, heightening the tension.', 'deformed anatomy, extra/missing fingers, extra limbs, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsi