('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_02_SH_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_003_SC_02', 'Wide Shot', 'Three-shot, machine center, characters positioned around it', 'Slightly high angle, static', '28mm', 'Slow dolly out', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\"]', 'Nneka steps forward to urge immediate shutdown. Kemi hesitates, hand hovering over a control lever. Tunde braces against the vibrating console.', 'Nneka: desperate, commanding. Kemi: frozen, torn. Tunde: braced, urgent.', 'Full sub-basement, machine dominating frame, pipes, server racks, concrete walls.', 'Pulsing red and blue emergency lights, machine core glowing intensely and flickering.', 'Critical, unstable, on the brink of failure.', 8, '[\"Loud mechanical grinding\", \"High-pitched feedback whine\", \"Structural creaks\"]', 'Climactic, driving orchestral hit fading into tense silence', 'Wide shot of the sub-basement archive dominated by a massive, decaying temporal resonance machine with exposed wiring and glowing core. Nneka Okafor (light brown smooth skin, angular sharp features, hazel piercing eyes, sleek shoulder-length jet black bob, silver geometric earrings, slender poised build) stands forward, arms outstretched, urging action. Kemi Adeyemi (deep brown lightly weathered skin, sharp jawline, high cheekbones, dark brown alert eyes, short cropped fade natural black hair, light stubble, small scar above left eyebrow, lean muscular build, grease-stained forearms) stands mid-frame, hand hovering near a control lever, frozen in hesitation. Tunde Balogun (medium brown skin, rounder open features, warm brown eyes, short neatly trimmed afro, freckles across nose bridge, stocky sturdy build, calloused hands) braces against the vibrating console to the right. Pulsing red and blue emergency lights illuminate the concrete walls and exposed pipes.', 'The machine\'s core pulses brighter, causing the entire room to vibrate slightly. Nneka steps forward urgently. Kemi\'s hand trembles above the control lever but doesn\'t pull it yet. Tunde grips the console tightly as warning lights strobe faster. The camera slowly dollies out, emphasizing the scale of the impending failure.', 'deformed anatomy, extra/missing fingers, extra limbs, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Machine state visibly degrades per location continuity rules. All three characters maintain established appearances and positioning. Sets up the violent overload for Scene 3.', '2026-09-27 07:00:22', '2026-09-27 07:00:22'),
