('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_02_SH_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_02', 'Medium Two-Shot', 'Waist-up, slightly low angle', 'Behind and slightly left of the main console', '35mm', 'Slow push-in', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', 'Kemi leans over the main console tracing analog dials with his grease-stained forearms, while Nneka connects her data drive to a terminal port and inputs commands.', 'Focused determination, professional tension softening into cooperation', 'Sub-Basement Archive with concrete walls, exposed pipes, server racks, and glowing console screens', 'Cool blue console glow mixing with dim overhead emergency lights', 'Claustrophobic, intense concentration, technologically advanced yet decaying', 8, '[\"Terminal beeps\", \"Low mechanical hum\", \"Keyboard clicks\", \"Data drive insertion click\"]', 'Tense, rhythmic synth pulse establishing a focused tempo', 'A cinematic medium two-shot in a claustrophobic Sub-Basement Archive with concrete walls, exposed pipes, and glowing console screens. Kemi Adeyemi, a lean muscular Nigerian man with deep brown skin, short cropped fade natural black hair, sharp jawline, high cheekbones, dark brown alert eyes, thick slightly arched eyebrows, thin pressed lips, a small scar above his left eyebrow, and grease-stained forearms, leans over a main console. Nneka Okafor, a slender poised Nigerian woman with light brown smooth skin, sleek shoulder-length jet black bob, angular sharp features, hazel piercing eyes, thin well-groomed eyebrows, thin firm lips, faint tension lines around her eyes, and silver geometric earrings, stands beside him connecting a data drive to a terminal port. Cool blue console glow illuminates the scene against dim overhead emergency lighting. Photorealistic, cinematic lighting, detailed textures.', 'Kemi leans forward to trace analog dials while Nneka plugs in her data drive and begins typing. The camera slowly pushes in as console screens flicker to life with scrolling data.', 'deformed anatomy, extra limbs, distorted faces, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, duplicate characters, blurry subject, low detail, watermark, text overlay', 'Establishes the cooperative dynamic after Nneka\'s reluctant agreement. Data drive is physically integrated into the console. Both characters are positioned at the main console.', '2026-09-27 07:51:37', '2026-09-27 07:51:37'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_02_SH_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_02', 'Close-Up', 'Over-the-shoulder focusing on screens and hands', 'Slightly above console level', '50mm', 'Static with slight focus pull from hands to screen', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', 'Nneka\'s fingers tap rapidly on a holographic keyboard while Kemi adjusts a physical dial, their hands working in tandem to align data streams.', 'Sharp concentration, mutual recognition of progress', 'Console interface displaying fragmented data streams and analog dials, sub-basement background softly blurred', 'Flickering amber warning lights begin to pulse alongside the steady blue console glow', 'Analytical breakthrough, rising tension, technical precision', 8, '[\"Digital chimes\", \"Dial turning\", \"Rising pitch synth\", \"Amber warning light buzz\"]', 'Tempo increases with layered strings, emphasizing the analytical breakthrough', 'A cinematic close-up over-the-shoulder shot focusing on a high-tech console interface and hands. Nneka Okafor\'s slender hands tap a holographic keyboard while Kemi Adeyemi\'s grease-stained forearms and muscular hands adjust a physical analog dial. Fragmented data streams visualize on glass screens. Kemi\'s deep brown skin and short cropped fade are visible at the edge of frame. Nneka\'s sleek shoulder-length jet black bob and silver geometric earrings catch the light. Amber warning lights pulse alongside cool blue console glow. Photorealistic, detailed textures, shallow depth of field.', 'Nneka\'s fingers move rapidly across the holographic keyboard while Kemi turns a physical dial. The camera holds steady as focus pulls from their hands to the console screen where fragmented data streams align into a coherent coordinate grid.', 'deformed anatomy, extra limbs, distorted faces, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, duplicate characters, blurry subject, low detail, watermark, text overlay', 'Coordinates are successfully pinpointed. Nneka\'s analytical input and Kemi\'s intuitive understanding merge. Amber warning lights introduce the first sign of system instability.', '2026-09-27 07:51:37', '2026-09-27 07:51:37'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_02_SH_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_02', 'Wide Shot', 'Full body, capturing the machine\'s core behind them', 'Behind the characters, looking toward the main machine', '24mm', 'Handheld, subtle shake to convey instability', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', 'The massive machine behind them shudders violently; energy arcs jump between pipes. Kemi braces against the console while Nneka stabilizes her footing, checking her drive\'s status.', 'Alert, bracing against the surge, heightened urgency', 'Sub-Basement Archive, exposed pipes vibrating, console screens flashing red error codes, server racks in background', 'Harsh strobing red and white emergency lighting cutting through the blue glow', 'Unstable, dangerous, high stakes, machine degradation visible', 8, '[\"Loud mechanical grinding\", \"Electrical crackling\", \"Alarms blaring\", \"Pipes rattling\"]', 'Dissonant, driving percussion with a tense crescendo mirroring the machine\'s resistance', 'A cinematic wide shot in the Sub-Basement Archive showing concrete walls, exposed pipes, server racks, and a massive dormant machine core in the background. Kemi Adeyemi, lean muscular build, deep brown skin, short cropped fade, sharp jawline, grease-stained forearms, braces against a main console. Nneka Okafor, slender poised build, light brown skin, sleek shoulder-length jet black bob, angular features, silver geometric earrings, stabilizes her stance beside him. Energy arcs jump between pipes. Console screens flash red error codes. Harsh strobing red and white emergency lighting dominates the scene. Photorealistic, cinematic lighting, detailed textures.', 'The massive machine core shudders violently as energy arcs jump between exposed pipes. Kemi braces against the console while Nneka adjusts her footing. The camera shakes subtly to match the mechanical instability as red error codes flash across the screens.', 'deformed anatomy, extra limbs, distorted faces, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, duplicate characters, blurry subject, low detail, watermark, text overlay', 'Machine\'s failing systems actively flicker and resist. Stakes are raised significantly. Coordinates remain locked but are threatened by the feedback loop. Sets up the need for manual override in the next shot.', '2026-09-27 07:51:37', '2026-09-27 07:51:37'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_02_SH_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_02', 'Medium Close-Up', 'Chest-up, two-shot', 'Frontal, slightly eye-level', '35mm', 'Slow zoom out', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', 'Kemi slams a heavy manual override lever down. Nneka watches the main display as the coordinates flash green and a digital countdown begins ticking down.', 'Resolute, relieved but tense, focused on the countdown', 'Console display dominating the foreground, sub-basement background slightly blurred', 'Stabilized cool blue light with a steady green countdown glow', 'Controlled danger, decisive action taken, impending cascade', 8, '[\"Heavy mechanical clunk\", \"Steady digital ticking\", \"Hum stabilizes slightly\", \"Low thrum of countdown\"]', 'Tense but resolved motif with a ticking clock rhythm, building anticipation for the next scene', 'A cinematic medium close-up two-shot facing forward. Kemi Adeyemi, lean muscular build, deep brown skin, short cropped fade, sharp jawline, dark brown alert eyes, grease-stained forearms, grips a heavy manual override lever. Nneka Okafor, slender poised build, light brown skin, sleek shoulder-length jet black bob, angular features, hazel piercing eyes, silver geometric earrings, stands beside him watching a console display. The display shows coordinates flashing green with a digital countdown timer. Sub-basement concrete walls and exposed pipes are softly blurred in the background. Stabilized cool blue lighting mixed with steady green countdown glow. Photorealistic, cinematic lighting, detailed textures.', 'Kemi forcefully pushes down the heavy override lever. The console display shifts from red to green as a digital countdown timer activates and begins ticking. The camera slowly zooms out as both characters lock eyes on the timer, bracing for the next phase.', 'deformed anatomy, extra limbs, distorted faces, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, duplicate characters, blurry subject, low detail, watermark, text overlay', 'Coordinates are firmly locked in. The countdown is officially initiated. The scene ends with the countdown running, directly leading into Scene 3\'s violent resistance and core cooling sequence.', '2026-09-27 07:51:37', '2026-09-27 07:51:37'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03_SH_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03', 'Medium Shot', 'Two-shot, Kemi and Nneka at the main console', 'Slightly low angle, looking up at the console', '35mm', 'Static, then slight handheld shake as surge hits', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', 'Kemi grips the console edge as arcs of blue-white energy crackle across the analog dials. Nneka\'s fingers fly across the power grid stabilizer panel.', 'Kemi: tense, focused, jaw clenched. Nneka: sharp, determined.', 'Sub-Basement Archive, concrete walls, exposed pipes, server racks, glowing console, flickering overhead fluorescents', 'Harsh emergency strobes mixed with cool blue machine glow, high contrast shadows', 'Claustrophobic, electrically charged, urgent', 8, '[\"High-pitched electrical whine\", \"Heavy mechanical grinding\", \"Sharp capacitor pops\", \"Distant rumbling\"]', 'Low, pulsing synth bass with rhythmic metallic percussion, building tension', 'Cinematic medium shot of Kemi Adeyemi, a lean 5\'10 Nigerian mechanic with short cropped fade, deep brown skin, light stubble, wearing a grease-stained grey mechanic\'s jumpsuit, gripping the edge of a complex analog console. Beside him stands Nneka Okafor, a slender Nigerian tech investigator with a sleek jet-black shoulder-length bob, light brown skin, wearing a dark tactical utility vest over a black t-shirt. The Sub-Basement Archive features rough concrete walls, exposed rusted pipes, and server racks. Blue-white electrical arcs crackle across glowing analog dials and a large projection screen. Harsh emergency strobes and cool blue machine lighting create high-contrast shadows. Photorealistic, cinematic lighting, detailed textures.', 'Electrical arcs violently pulse across the console dials. Kemi\'s knuckles whiten as he grips the metal edge. Nneka\'s fingers rapidly press switches on the adjacent stabilizer panel. Camera shakes slightly in sync with the energy surges. Overhead lights flicker rapidly.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, missing limbs, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Countdown timer visible on console (around 45 seconds). Both characters braced. Machine state actively degrading.', '2026-09-27 08:04:14', '2026-09-27 08:04:14'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03_SH_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03', 'Close Up', 'Tight on Kemi\'s hands and the override lever', 'Eye level', '50mm', 'Slow push-in', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', 'Kemi wrestles a heavy red safety override lever downward against mechanical resistance. Sweat beads on his forehead.', 'Kemi: strained, resolute. Nneka: intensely focused off-screen.', 'Tight framing on the console\'s override mechanism, grease-stained metal, warning labels, sparking wires', 'Warm tungsten spill from the lever housing contrasting with cool blue background spill', 'Gritty, tactile, high-stakes', 8, '[\"Heavy metallic clunk\", \"Grinding gears\", \"Hissing steam\", \"Frantic keyboard tapping\"]', 'Tempo increases, strings introduce a dissonant, driving motif', 'Extreme close-up of Kemi Adeyemi\'s grease-stained forearms and hands forcefully pushing down a heavy industrial red override lever on a complex machine console. His knuckles are white, sweat glistens on his deep brown skin. The lever housing is brushed steel with faded warning decals. In the shallow depth of field background, Nneka Okafor\'s sleek black bob and tactical vest are visible as she monitors adjacent screens. Cool blue ambient light mixes with warm practical lighting from the console. Cinematic, highly detailed, photorealistic.', 'Kemi\'s hands strain against the lever, pushing it down inch by inch. Sparks fly from the base of the lever housing. Nneka\'s hands move rapidly across a touchscreen in the background. Camera slowly pushes in on the lever mechanism.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, missing limbs, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Override lever engaged. Countdown around 30 seconds. Nneka managing grid stabilization.', '2026-09-27 08:04:14', '2026-09-27 08:04:14'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03_SH_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03', 'Close Up', 'Single shot, Kemi\'s face', 'Eye level', '85mm', 'Static, subtle focus pull', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\"]', 'Kemi looks up from the console toward a flickering projection screen showing fragmented echoes of his father\'s workshop. He closes his eyes briefly, accepting the finality.', 'Kemi: sorrowful, resolute, peaceful acceptance', 'Sub-Basement, projection screen casting shifting light on his face, concrete background', 'Soft, shifting blue and amber light from the projection screen illuminates his face', 'Intimate, poignant, emotionally heavy', 8, '[\"Electrical surges muffle into a low hum\", \"Faint overlapping whispers of past echoes\", \"Steady breathing\"]', 'Music drops to a solitary, mournful cello line, leaving space for the dialogue and ambient sound', 'Close-up of Kemi Adeyemi\'s face, sharp jawline, high cheekbones, short cropped fade, deep brown skin with light stubble. His dark brown eyes look upward with a mix of sorrow and resolve. Flickering light from a large projection screen casts shifting blue and amber tones across his features. The background shows the rough concrete walls and exposed pipes of the Sub-Basement Archive. Cinematic lighting, shallow depth of field, photorealistic.', 'The shifting light from the projection screen washes over Kemi\'s face. He blinks slowly, his expression softening from tension to quiet acceptance. He takes a deep breath and nods almost imperceptibly. Camera holds steady on his face.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, missing limbs, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Emotional pivot point. Machine surges begin to dampen. Countdown around 15 seconds.', '2026-09-27 08:04:14', '2026-09-27 08:04:14'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03_SH_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_03', 'Wide Shot', 'Full room, Kemi and Nneka standing back from the console', 'Slightly elevated, looking down at the machine', '24mm', 'Slow pull back and tilt down', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', 'The violent arcing stops. The machine\'s core glows dimly as it powers down. The projection screen goes dark. Both characters lower their guard, exhaling.', 'Kemi: relieved, exhausted. Nneka: stunned, quietly respectful', 'Sub-Basement Archive, now quiet, machine dormant, dust motes in the air', 'Dim, cool ambient light, harsh strobes gone, soft practicals remain', 'Heavy silence, aftermath, closure', 8, '[\"High-pitched whine fades out\", \"Heavy mechanical thrum drops to a low idle\", \"Distant dripping water\", \"Soft exhales\"]', 'Cello resolves into a quiet, sustained ambient pad, fading into natural room tone', 'Wide shot of the Sub-Basement Archive showing the full machine console and projection screen. Kemi Adeyemi and Nneka Okafor stand a few feet back from the console, shoulders relaxed. The machine\'s core emits a faint, fading blue glow. The concrete walls, exposed pipes, and server racks are visible in the dim lighting. Dust motes float in the air. The atmosphere is heavy and silent. Cinematic, photorealistic, wide framing.', 'The violent electrical arcs completely cease. The machine\'s core light dims steadily until it\'s nearly dark. The projection screen flickers once and goes black. Kemi and Nneka both lower their arms and exhale deeply. Camera slowly pulls back and tilts down to emphasize the silence and scale of the room.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, missing limbs, distorted face, duplicate character, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Machine fully dormant. Core cooling. Echoes gone. Ready for transition to Scene 4.', '2026-09-27 08:04:14', '2026-09-27 08:04:14'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04_SH_01', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04', 'Wide / Establishing', 'Low angle looking up the stairwell', 'Bottom of concrete stairs, facing upward through the heavy steel door', '35mm', 'Static', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', 'Heavy steel door creaks open. Kemi and Nneka step up from the sub-basement, shoulders dropping as they leave the heavy machinery behind.', 'Kemi: exhausted relief, eyes adjusting to light. Nneka: watchful but calmer.', 'Concrete stairs, heavy steel door, transition from dark sub-basement shadows to bright workshop interior', 'High contrast, harsh natural sunlight cutting through dust motes, deep shadows behind', 'Quiet, transitional, heavy silence giving way to ambient workshop sounds', 8, '[\"Heavy door hinge groan\", \"Footsteps on concrete\", \"Distant workshop hum fading in\"]', 'Low, resolving ambient tone that slowly fades into natural soundscape', 'Wide shot looking up concrete stairs through an opening heavy steel door. Sunlight floods the frame, illuminating dust particles. Kemi Adeyemi, a lean muscular Nigerian man with deep brown skin, short cropped fade, and grease-stained forearms, steps forward with an exhausted but relieved posture. Behind him, Nneka Okafor, a slender Nigerian woman with light brown skin, a sleek shoulder-length jet black bob, and silver geometric earrings, follows with a watchful but calm expression. The background transitions from dark sub-basement shadows to the bright, cluttered interior of an auto workshop.', 'Heavy steel door slowly swings open, sunlight spills across the concrete stairs, Kemi and Nneka walk upward into the light, shoulders visibly relaxing as they leave the dark basement behind.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, distorted faces, duplicate characters, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Matches continuity pointer: danger neutralized, calm/exhausted tone, transitioning from LOC_002 to LOC_001. Grease on forearms carried forward.', '2026-09-27 08:14:19', '2026-09-27 08:14:19'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04_SH_02', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04', 'Medium Close-Up', 'Eye level, focused on Kemi\'s torso and hands', 'Standing slightly to Kemi\'s right', '50mm', 'Static', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\"]', 'Kemi grabs a worn shop rag and thoroughly wipes the thick grease from his hands and forearms. He takes a deep breath, his gaze sweeping the familiar workshop.', 'Grounded, resolute, small scar above left eyebrow visible as he squints slightly in the sun', 'Sunlit auto workshop interior, tool racks and car lifts blurred in background', 'Bright, directional sunlight from bay doors, warm highlights on skin and rag', 'Quiet routine, shedding the tension of the previous hours', 8, '[\"Rag wiping against skin\", \"Distant clink of tools\", \"Low ambient workshop noise\"]', 'Gentle, acoustic guitar motif begins, grounding and steady', 'Medium close-up of Kemi Adeyemi standing in a sunlit auto workshop. He has deep brown skin, a sharp jawline, thick slightly arched eyebrows, and a small scar above his left eyebrow. He holds a worn gray shop rag, wiping thick black grease from his forearms. His short cropped fade and lean muscular build are visible. Bright sunlight streams from off-screen bay doors, casting warm highlights. Background shows blurred tool racks and car lifts of the Adeyemi Auto Workshop.', 'Kemi firmly wipes grease from his hands and forearms with a rag, takes a slow deep breath, and lets his shoulders drop further as he looks around the familiar workshop.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, distorted faces, duplicate characters, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Grease-stained forearms continuity maintained. LOC_001 fully established. Emotional shift to routine begins.', '2026-09-27 08:14:19', '2026-09-27 08:14:19'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04_SH_03', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04', 'Two-Shot / Medium', 'Eye level, side profile', 'Facing the workbench from the aisle', '35mm', 'Slow push in', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\"]', 'Kemi walks over to a cluttered workbench where Tunde is waiting. Tunde slides a standard steel wrench across the metal surface. Kemi picks it up, the weight familiar in his hand.', 'Tunde: warm, expectant smile. Kemi: focused, quiet determination', 'Workbench covered in mechanical parts, sunlit background, open bay doors visible behind', 'Natural daylight, soft shadows under the bench overhang', 'Collaborative, grounded, returning to normalcy', 8, '[\"Metal wrench sliding on steel bench\", \"Light mechanical clatter\", \"Distant radio chatter\"]', 'Steady, rhythmic percussion enters, mirroring mechanical work', 'Medium two-shot of Kemi Adeyemi and Tunde Balogun at a cluttered metal workbench in a sunlit auto workshop. Tunde, a stocky Nigerian man with medium brown skin, a neatly trimmed short afro, freckles across his nose, and calloused hands, slides a standard steel wrench across the bench. Kemi, with his lean muscular build and short cropped fade, reaches out to grip the wrench handle. Sunlight streams through open bay doors in the background, illuminating dust and mechanical parts on the bench.', 'Tunde slides a standard steel wrench across the workbench toward Kemi, Kemi reaches out and firmly grips the handle, both men exchange a quiet, grounded look before turning their attention to the task ahead.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, distorted faces, duplicate characters, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Tunde\'s features match bible exactly. Kemi\'s routine action matches beat. No reference to hidden compartment or machine.', '2026-09-27 08:14:19', '2026-09-27 08:14:19'),
('nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04_SH_04', 'nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__EP_004_SC_04', 'Wide / Environmental', 'High angle looking down at workbench', 'Overhead near ceiling rafters', '24mm', 'Static', '[\"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_001\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_002\", \"nigerian_mechanic_past_machine__CHAR_003\"]', 'Kemi and Tunde work side-by-side at the bench. Kemi deliberately turns his back toward the area where the hidden compartment/stairs would be. Nneka stands near the bay doors, observing but not interfering.', 'Kemi: calm acceptance. Tunde: focused. Nneka: respectful distance', 'Full workshop view, open bay doors, sunlight flooding the space, tools organized, cars on lifts', 'Bright, even daylight, high key but with natural gritty texture', 'Closure, peaceful routine, chapter ended', 8, '[\"Ratchet turning\", \"Steady workshop hum\", \"Distant city traffic\"]', 'Music swells gently then fades completely into natural ambient soundscape', 'Wide high-angle shot of the Adeyemi Auto Workshop interior. Kemi Adeyemi and Tunde Balogun work side-by-side at a cluttered metal workbench, Kemi deliberately facing away from the stairwell area. Nneka Okafor stands calmly near the large open bay doors in the background, her sleek shoulder-length bob and silver geometric earrings catching the sunlight. The workshop is filled with bright natural daylight, car lifts, tool racks, and scattered mechanical parts. The atmosphere is peaceful and grounded.', 'Kemi and Tunde begin working on a vehicle part at the bench, Kemi keeps his back turned to the stairwell area, Nneka watches quietly from the bay doors as sunlight fills the workshop, conveying a sense of finality and return to routine.', 'deformed anatomy, extra fingers, distorted faces, duplicate characters, inconsistent clothing, malformed hands, unwanted text, watermark, low detail, blurry subject', 'Deliberately leaves compartment sealed/unseen. Embraces present day as requested. Chapter closure achieved. All character visual traits consistent.', '2026-09-27 08:14:19', '2026-09-27 08:14:19');

